# The only image built from the repo root is the dev-env indexer
# (dev-env/build/indexer.Dockerfile), which needs just apps/indexer and the
# shared lexicons. Everything else — notably the 19G Rust target/ — must stay
# out of the build context. Ignore all, then re-include what the build copies.
*
!apps/indexer
!lexicons

# Drop build artifacts even within the re-included paths; the image runs a
# fresh mix deps.get / compile.
apps/indexer/_build
apps/indexer/deps
apps/indexer/.elixir_ls
**/.DS_Store
